{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114387","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114387/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114387/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114387/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114387","id":3765216453,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc66t9c9","number":114387,"title":"Fix `Input.is_action_just_pressed_by_event` / `Input.is_action_just_released_by_event` not working for `InputEventMouseButton`","user":{"login":"TranquilMarmot","id":504259,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDI1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/504259?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot","html_url":"https://github.com/TranquilMarmot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5795,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T11:06:04Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-12-28T01:04:41Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T11:11:59Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114387","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114387","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114387.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114387.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113472\r\n\r\nCurrently, `Input.is_action_just_pressed_by_event` and `Input.is_action_just_released_by_event` rely on comparing the event's `get_instance_id()`.\r\n\r\n_However,_ for `InputEventMouseButton` there are a few instances where the event is modified and a new instance is created.\r\n\r\nFor example...\r\n\r\nWhen `emulate_mouse_from_touch` is `true`:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/63227bbc8ae5300319f14f8253c8158b846f355b/core/input/input.cpp#L863-L885\r\n\r\nInside of `Input::ensure_touch_mouse_raised`:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/63227bbc8ae5300319f14f8253c8158b846f355b/core/input/input.cpp#L1166-L1187\r\n\r\nInside of `InputEventMouseButton::xformed_by`:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/63227bbc8ae5300319f14f8253c8158b846f355b/core/input/input_event.cpp#L742-L766\r\n\r\nThe fix I've implemented here is to store the `InputEvent` itself instead of just its instance ID and, when doing a comparison with an `InputEventMouseButton`, check if `is_match` is true.\r\n\r\nI tried to use `is_match` for other events but that wasn't as reliable as the instance ID and resulted in some events double-firing, so I opted to only fall back on it for the mouse input events.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114387/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114387/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}